flowchart TD
  classDef validated fill:#dff5e1,stroke:#237a3b,color:#102a16
  classDef boundary fill:#fff4cc,stroke:#9c7a00,color:#332700
  classDef forbidden fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#b42318,color:#3b0a08
  classDef store fill:#e6f0ff,stroke:#2457a6,color:#10284f

  A[Branch operation] --> B{ORTEC active?}
  B -- No --> STD[Standard abapGit behavior unchanged]
  B -- Yes --> R[Resolve repository key and advertised branch tip]
  R --> C{Certified local state}

  C -- Warm unchanged --> W[Serve verified snapshot locally]
  C -- Known changed tip --> I[Incremental fetch with certified haves]
  C -- Unknown or uncertified --> G[Cold blobless graph acquisition]

  I --> V1[Verify received graph and selected tip blobs]
  G --> GC[Verify requested commit and complete tree closure]
  GC --> MG[Publish GRAPH_COMPLETE]
  MG --> MB[Materialize current-tip blobs in bounded batches]
  MB --> V2[Verify complete selected blob set]
  V1 --> MF[Mark FULL_COMPLETE]
  V2 --> MF
  MF --> RP[Prepare repository bookkeeping]
  RP --> PS[Publish SNAPSHOT_COMPLETE]
  PS --> FC[Persisted invariant: HIST_LEVEL F and SNAP_STATE C]
  W --> OUT[Files and deltas reconstructed]
  FC --> OUT

  I -. pack decode .-> D1B[Package D1 boundary: generalized external delta-base resolution]
  G -. pack decode .-> D1B
  D1B -. publication safety .-> D2B[Package D2 boundary: attempt/session/transaction isolation]

  OS[(Repository-shared SHA object store)]
  RS[(Branch/ref state)]
  CH[(Commit materialization certificates)]
  I --> OS
  G --> OS
  MB --> OS
  RP --> RS
  MF --> CH
  PS --> RS

  X1[No deepen or shallow correctness strategy]
  X2[No per-object SQL or HTTP]
  X3[No uncertified haves]
  X4[No snapshot C before history F]

  class STD,W,I,G,GC,MG,MB,V1,V2,MF,RP,PS,FC,OUT,OS,RS,CH validated
  class D1B,D2B boundary
  class X1,X2,X3,X4 forbidden
  class OS,RS,CH store
